          "name": "How do I verify if an electrician in Frodsham is legally qualified?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Check their credentials on the Registered Competent Person Electrical register. Carter Electrical is fully NICEIC-approved. We self-certify all domestic and commercial work, automatically registering installations with local Building Control."
